flowchart TD
    PM(開發者撰寫或修改需求)
    WaitCallSDA(等待開發者呼叫SDA)
    SDA(System Design Agent)
    IsClearRequirement{需求是否不清楚或需要PM決斷}
    HaveDevelopIssue{是否有開發問題}
    PA(Programmer Agent)
    IsPassCodeReview{程式碼審查是否通過}
    CRA(Code Review Agent)
    Finish(完成)

    PM -->  WaitCallSDA
    WaitCallSDA --> SDA
    SDA --> IsClearRequirement
    IsClearRequirement --> |不清楚| PM
    IsClearRequirement --> |清楚| PA
    PA --> HaveDevelopIssue
    HaveDevelopIssue --> |有問題| SDA
    HaveDevelopIssue --> |無問題| CRA
    CRA --> IsPassCodeReview
    IsPassCodeReview --> |否| PA
    IsPassCodeReview --> |是| Finish
    
